                                                "sense_id": "a921107a-dc33-3d4b-aab7-fd08fd062542",
                                                "text": "And four years after Pep from Catalonia first clapped eyes on Phil from Stockport across a crowded rondo, here finally was the consummation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7904ea1f-d723-343d-87ce-1312efa57e87",
